	(text
		"DESIGN NOTES\nNEO-F10N dual-band L1/L5: NavIC SPS-L5 required by AIS-140. RF_IN has an internal DC block.\nActive antenna bias from VCC_RF through R35/L2 (u-blox IM fig.6); DNP R35+L2 for passive antennas.\nRF trace: 50 R CPWG on L1 over solid L2 ground, via fence every 1.5 mm, no other nets nearby.\nUART 1 k series resistors stop back-powering while GNSS VCC is switched off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 85.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b93131c6-3935-5f6a-9a64-a40c4c2f8037")
	)
	(text
		"PART NOTES (VERIFY = check against vendor datasheet before release)\nC36: V_BCKP: always-on for hot start\nR33: limits back-power while GNSS VCC is off\nR35: u-blox R17 10 R short-circuit limiter\nL2: DNP L2+R35 for a passive antenna"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219.71 85.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8b6bfbc4-f2f3-5376-a59f-0c972e9a9f90")
	)
